21172172100180_4190219964849874674_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tGhy9vyh-lQQ7kNvwEJVp-0&_nc_oc=AdrXBW1feII-1eMwU8p2WIkNbbnwT_G3HAQgyXG6jsL5z0bYBgCN9daSoxaw_LzXWdU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQREehESjFXQbS54Q1olUOZz5FZOuGkOx8h7iAkyQ-nyYw&oe=6B0C5BCF"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_2_2560x1440.png", "id": "1147217217729673", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/757345450_1147217221063006_8385437369859722188_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wcfYG2d1QAgQ7kNvwGs5NAv&_nc_oc=Ado1gYUedo_Lez7-HOdegPOo3Fp20TVCxTHgEHgCPcJDCB5bLYHpfqmEDv2w7AZv9WE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRc1u6I9LwfwiiAVK2tToLhHvgsVMynTpi5pHjPe59zzQ&oe=6B0C5092"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_1_2560x1440.png", "id": "1794137925167825", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654867655_1794137928501158_7577090301496098425_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9H6SG7kowCcQ7kNvwE12iMD&_nc_oc=AdpolzSOAvH72nwqFrPcfE8Dyo_CIYd-hPeqNsB2ege6XyfWIJucgpsye3uGAWI2U5w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSY3UpEDNPtbPSnThGd_ZUbkHeki40mUif_YkmTw7WgEQ&oe=6B0C67ED"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "1625456292373017", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/806363909_1625456295706350_3028832981312505522_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=otND3ZPQDwQQ7kNvwH5RqIx&_nc_oc=AdoElxiIkAUl9x_WoettmTYnmJUcGn2-UXde4Wch3Ug2x6Kj-tCGuKgz6_JxRXZOgtM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRVCNg6A_SMCxJECgXtQHzfNUl890aCMK7_YsnRnLRwzQ&oe=6B0C56B0"}, "display_name": "BUBBLE QUAKE", "keywords": ["bubbles", "pop", "puzzle", "family", "arcade"], "long_description": "**Bubblequake** turns your room into a playground of glossy, candy colored bubbles. A toy bubble machine lands on your table and blows bubbles all around you, and your bare hands do the rest. No controllers needed.\n\n**POP, CHOP, PINCH**\n\nPoke bubbles to pop them. Caged bubbles shrug off a poke, so chop through them with a flat hand. Tiny bubbles dodge your finger, so pinch them. And keep your hands off the spiky ones!\n\n**CHAIN THE COLORS**\n\nPop one color again and again to build a chain. Three in a row sets off a BLAST, five a MEGA BLAST, and seven a COLOR WIPE that pops every bubble of that color in the room, in slow motion, with confetti. Rainbow bubbles match any color to keep your chain alive.\n\n**ONE TOUCH PUZZLES**\n\nOne pop. One chain reaction. Find the bubble that sets off the whole cluster.\n\n**BUBBLE BOSSES**\n\nEvery tenth level a giant grumpy bubble shows up with a ring of shield bubbles. Pop them in the color it shows, then chop it until it bursts.\n\n**100+ LEVELS AND BEYOND**\n\nTen themed worlds, from Fizz School to Grand Fizz, then endless Remix laps that keep getting harder.\n\n**FOR THE WHOLE FAMILY**\n\nEveryone picks their own initials, keeps their own progress, and battles for a spot on every level's top 10. Online leaderboards show how you stack up against the world and your friends.\n\nBuilt for mixed reality on Meta Quest 3 and 3S: bubbles bounce off your real walls and furniture.", "short_description": "Pop your room into a bubble storm! Bubblequake is a mixed reality puzzle game for bare hands: poke, chop and pinch candy colored bubbles that bounce around your real room. Pop the same color in a row to set off blasts and room wide color wipes, solve One Touch chain reaction puzzles, and topple grumpy giant bubble bosses across 100+ levels. Every player picks their initials and chases the family high score."}]}, "developer_name": "Potzer LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bubblequake.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Potzer LLC", "suppor